        <mxCell id="c109" value="No graceful exit within the stop timeout (120 s) and no job running: the process tree is terminated (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;Action::Kill&lt;/span&gt;). A runner that exits again and again is a crash loop: five exits in ten minutes pause restarts for 30 minutes, notify, and a manual Start clears it. Silence is never a stall: an idle runner logs nothing for hours." style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#17181C;fontSize=11;shape=note;size=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555A65;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="1454" width="800" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
